      "side": 1,
      "message": "Setting `P3S_CONTEXT_REMOTE_MM(ctx-\u003emm)` here makes `PAGE_SIZE`/`PAGE_MASK` evaluate to `ctx-\u003emm`\u0027s page size, which is right for `dst` and `len`. However, in `userfaultfd_copy()`, `validate_unaligned_range(ctx-\u003emm, uffdio_copy.src, uffdio_copy.len)` checks `uffdio_copy.src` against `ctx-\u003emm-\u003etask_size` (`TASK_SIZE_4KB` \u003d 512 GB for a 4KB target process).\n\nBecause `uffdio_copy.src` is in the caller\u0027s address space (`current-\u003emm`), a native 16KB monitor process (`TASK_SIZE_64`) servicing faults for a 4KB process will fail with `-EINVAL` whenever its source buffer is mapped above 512 GB.\n\nPlease squash up-stack fix aosp/4367947 (\"ANDROID: P3S: userfaultfd: Validate COPY source in the caller mm\") into this change.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "1f5ac3f00fa7dd8c1ffda11b32d6f076afe5d251",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
